-- Cell retirement (`CON–CON` annihilation, `vxchg` 1st-arrival park, `ROOT` delivery, or §4.5 prune):
-- pushes freed `cid` onto the local consumer tile's `freeStack` (`live = suc l -> l`).
pool-retire : Nat → Word → List Word → HeapPool
pool-retire l freedId restFree = hpool l (cons freedId restFree)
